# Contracts

- Commands, events, snapshots, and errors are shared Zod schemas.
- Every significant event needs structured payload and plain-text narration.
- Semantic segments are data, not a client parsing prose.
- Do not break existing event fixtures without a versioned migration plan.
- The client must not claim a different account, role, or character in command fields.
